column1:
where ... is concerned; when it becomes;
いざ||と○○○||勇気が湧いてくる。
その計画が実行できない||と○○○||、どうしなければなりませんか。,となれば,where ... is concerned; when it becomes; if it becomes,"expressions (phrases, clauses, etc.)",Text

how should I put it?; what shall I say?;
僕は先生が||何○○○○||恐い。
彼は||何○○○○||しら。,"なんというか,何と言うか","how should I put it?; what shall I say?; well, you know; like","expressions (phrases, clauses, etc.)",Text
